       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. OVISET6.
      * OVERDUE INTEREST - STEP 1 RUN FLAG
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY OVIFLG6.
       01  WS-CYCLE-DAY              PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-CYCLE-DAY
           IF WS-CYCLE-DAY > 25
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-OVD-INT-RUN
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'RUN: ' WS-OVD-INT-RUN
           STOP RUN.
